lass=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/en/\">Home</a> › <a href=\"/en/surah/71.html\">Surah Nooh</a> › Verse 16</nav><h1>Tafsir of Surah Nooh 71:16</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَجَعَلَ الْقَمَرَ فِيهِنَّ نُورًا وَجَعَلَ الشَّمْسَ سِرَاجًا﴾</p><section><h3>Translation of the meaning</h3><p class=\"tr\">And made the moon therein a [reflected] light and made the sun a burning lamp?</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">English Translation - Noor International Center — v1.1.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">The words of the two imams are given in their original Arabic, verbatim, with references.</p><section><h2>Shaykh al-Islam Ibn Taymiyyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فأخبر أنه جعل الشمس والقمر في السموات.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 6/598</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=en#s71a16\">Open in the interactive tafsir (full texts)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/en/ayah/71-15.html\">Previous verse (71:15)</a><a href=\"/en/ayah/71-17.html\">Next verse (71:17)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Shaykhayn · <a href=\"/en/\">Home</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">About the project</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privacy &amp; terms</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/71-17.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir of Nooh 71:17 — by Ibn Taymiyyah and Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"And Allāh has caused you to grow from the earth a [progressive] growth.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/71-17.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/71-17.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/71-17.html\">\n<link rel=\"al